<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	The simulation of a project (haumacher/ehome #58, #62, de.haumacher.ehome.simulation): the runtime image of
	the project (its rules, schedules and datapoints) run against a virtual installation of its devices on the
	loopback address, on a simulated clock that moves by "Step" (to the next timer, schedule firing or
	midnight), "Fast-forward" (by the duration entered) and, after "Real time", "10 times" or "60 times" until
	"Pause", by itself at that multiple of real time. At most one simulation runs per project, shared by
	everybody looking at the project; it is stopped when the application shuts down. The virtual installation
	is a KNXnet/IP gateway (the status names it), which the group monitor reaches like a real one. With a time
	master in the project's settings, the simulation broadcasts the simulated time on its addresses as the
	controller does (TimeMaster).

	"project" is the project. "state" is the state of the simulation (simulationState, SimulationFunctions),
	recomputed from "refresh", which every command writes and, while the view is displayed, every change of
	the simulation (a source channel fed by SimulationSource: a telegram arriving, the clock moving, a
	rule acting, at most every 500 ms). The rows of the tables stand for their rule, parameter, datapoint or
	entry, so a selection survives the updates.

	- Rules: per rule the diagnostics of the engine - enabled, state, firings, last trigger and last action
	with their simulated times, errors and the last error, the remaining time of its timers and the values
	of its parameters (* an override).
	- Parameters: every parameter of every rule (the enable switch included) with its value, default and
	whether it is an override; "Set" and "Reset" change the selected one as a controller's UI does. The
	overrides are stored with the rules of the project (simulationValue, simulationEnabled) and are the values
	the next simulation starts with.
	- Datapoints: the datapoints of the image with value, quality, time of the last update and binding.
	"Send" lets a device of the installation send the value to the datapoint's group address (the device whose
	object sends there, else an input device of the installation); "Command" commands the datapoint as a
	controller's UI does. For a Zigbee datapoint "Send" makes its virtual device report the value.
	- Zigbee devices: the functions of the Zigbee devices bound to datapoints of the image (VirtualZigbee), one
	row each with the device, the endpoint, the function, the datapoint, its value and the time of the last
	report. "Report from the device" makes the virtual device report the value (simulationSend; for a button,
	an "action", a press); "Command" commands the datapoint as the controller's UI does: a function with a
	command cluster takes the value and reports it back, any other refuses it (read-only). The devices keep
	their values for the next simulation of the project (in memory) and report them at its start. Functions
	bound to no datapoint are not in the image and so not in the simulation.
	- Timeline: what happened, newest first: telegrams received and sent, the Zigbee reports, presses and
	commands, commands of the rules, logs of the rules and the scheduler, parameter changes, the clock and the
	problems.
	- Device behaviour: the object followers of the project (ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower): which object of a
	device takes the values another object of the device receives (a channel's state following its switching
	object), inverted for an object of one bit. The program data of a device does not say this, so the user
	names the pairs; they take effect when a simulation starts.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="project"/>
		<!-- A new value on every change of the simulation while the view is displayed, at most every 500 ms. -->
		<source-channel name="refresh"
			update-interval="500"
		>
			<source class="de.haumacher.ehome.simulation.SimulationSource"
				project="project"
			/>
		</source-channel>
		<channel name="startTime"/>
		<channel name="duration"/>
		<channel name="selectedParameter"/>
		<channel name="parameterValue"/>
		<channel name="selectedDatapoint"/>
		<channel name="datapointValue"/>
		<channel name="selectedZigbee"/>
		<channel name="zigbeeValue"/>
		<channel name="follower"/>
		<derived-channel name="state"
			expr="simulationState($project, $refresh)"
			inputs="project, refresh"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="status"
			expr="$state['status']"
			inputs="state"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="next"
			expr="$state['next']"
			inputs="state"
		/>
		<derived-channel name="clock"
			expr="$state['clock']"
			inputs="state"
		/>
	</channels>
	<split-panel
		orientation="vertical"
		resizable="true"
	>
		<panes>
			<pane
				min-size="160"
				size="25"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Simulation</en>
						<de>Simulation</de>
					</title>
					<commands>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-play-circle"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Start</en>
								<de>Starten</de>
							</label>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationStartVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationStart($state['project'], $startTime)">
								<inputs>
									<input channel="startTime"/>
								</inputs>
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-play"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Real time</en>
								<de>Echtzeit</de>
							</label>
							<tooltip>
								<en>Lets the simulated clock run by itself in real time until "Pause"; timers and schedules fire when they fall due.</en>
								<de>Lässt die simulierte Uhr in Echtzeit von selbst laufen, bis „Pause“; Timer und Zeitpläne lösen aus, wenn sie fällig werden.</de>
							</tooltip>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationSpeedVeto($state['project'], 1, $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationRun($state['project'], 1)">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-speedometer"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>10 times real time</en>
								<de>10-fache Echtzeit</de>
							</label>
							<tooltip>
								<en>Lets the simulated clock run by itself ten times as fast as real time until "Pause": an hour passes in six minutes.</en>
								<de>Lässt die simulierte Uhr zehnmal so schnell wie in Echtzeit laufen, bis „Pause“: Eine Stunde vergeht in sechs Minuten.</de>
							</tooltip>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationSpeedVeto($state['project'], 10, $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationRun($state['project'], 10)">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-speedometer2"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>60 times real time</en>
								<de>60-fache Echtzeit</de>
							</label>
							<tooltip>
								<en>Lets the simulated clock run by itself sixty times as fast as real time until "Pause": an hour passes in a minute.</en>
								<de>Lässt die simulierte Uhr sechzigmal so schnell wie in Echtzeit laufen, bis „Pause“: Eine Stunde vergeht in einer Minute.</de>
							</tooltip>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationSpeedVeto($state['project'], 60, $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationRun($state['project'], 60)">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-pause-circle"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Pause</en>
								<de>Pause</de>
							</label>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationPauseVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationPause($state['project'])">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-skip-end"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Step</en>
								<de>Schritt</de>
							</label>
							<tooltip>
								<en>Moves the simulated clock at once to the next timer, schedule firing or midnight (at most a day ahead) and runs what is due then.</en>
								<de>Stellt die simulierte Uhr sofort auf den nächsten Timer, die nächste Auslösung eines Zeitplans oder Mitternacht vor (höchstens einen Tag) und führt aus, was dann fällig ist.</de>
							</tooltip>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationStep($state['project'])">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-fast-forward"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Fast-forward</en>
								<de>Vorspulen</de>
							</label>
							<tooltip>
								<en>Moves the simulated clock at once forward by the duration entered (30min if empty); the timers and schedules on the way fire each at its own time.</en>
								<de>Stellt die simulierte Uhr sofort um die eingegebene Dauer vor (30min, wenn leer); Timer und Zeitpläne auf dem Weg lösen jeweils zu ihrer Zeit aus.</de>
							</tooltip>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationAdvance($state['project'], if($duration == null, '30min', $duration))">
								<inputs>
									<input channel="duration"/>
								</inputs>
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-stop-circle"
							inputs="state, project"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Stop</en>
								<de>Anhalten</de>
							</label>
							<access>
								<operation name="Write"
									object="$project"
									type="ehome.project:Project"
								/>
							</access>
							<executability>
								<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
							</executability>
							<execute-script function="simulationStop($state['project'])">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-arrow-clockwise"
							inputs="state"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Refresh</en>
								<de>Aktualisieren</de>
							</label>
							<tooltip>
								<en>Reads the state of the simulation again; while the tab is shown, it also updates by itself on every change.</en>
								<de>Liest den Zustand der Simulation neu; solange der Reiter angezeigt wird, aktualisiert er sich auch bei jeder Änderung von selbst.</de>
							</tooltip>
							<execute-script function="simulationState($state['project'])">
								<with-result>
									<write-channel name="refresh"/>
								</with-result>
							</execute-script>
						</generic-command>
					</commands>
					<inset>
						<stack gap="compact">
							<text input="status"/>
							<text
								input="next"
								tone="secondary"
							/>
							<text
								input="clock"
								tone="secondary"
							/>
							<fields>
								<value-input
									type="tl.core:DateTime"
									value="startTime"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Start of the simulated clock</en>
										<de>Beginn der simulierten Uhr</de>
									</label>
									<placeholder>
										<en>Now</en>
										<de>Jetzt</de>
									</placeholder>
								</value-input>
								<value-input
									type="tl.core:String"
									value="duration"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Fast-forward by</en>
										<de>Vorspulen um</de>
									</label>
									<placeholder>
										<en>30min</en>
										<de>30min</de>
									</placeholder>
								</value-input>
							</fields>
						</stack>
					</inset>
				</panel>
			</pane>
			<pane
				min-size="200"
				size="75"
				unit="%"
			>
				<tab-bar active-tab="rules">
					<tabs>
						<tab id="rules"
							icon="css:bi bi-diagram-3"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Rules</en>
								<de>Regeln</de>
							</label>
							<table filter-bar="true">
								<inputs>
									<input channel="state"/>
								</inputs>
								<columns>
									<computed-column name="id"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="160"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Rule</en>
											<de>Regel</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['id']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="enabled"
										type="tl.core:Boolean"
										width="90"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Enabled</en>
											<de>Aktiv</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['enabled']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="ruleState"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="110"
									>
										<label>
											<en>State</en>
											<de>Zustand</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['state']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="firings"
										type="tl.core:Integer"
										width="90"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Firings</en>
											<de>Auslösungen</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['firings']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="trigger"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="280"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Last trigger</en>
											<de>Letzter Auslöser</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['trigger']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="action"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="300"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Last action</en>
											<de>Letzte Aktion</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['action']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="timers"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="160"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Timers</en>
											<de>Timer</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['timers']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="parameters"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="220"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Parameters</en>
											<de>Parameter</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['parameters']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="errors"
										type="tl.core:Integer"
										width="80"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Errors</en>
											<de>Fehler</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['errors']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="error"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="300"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Last error</en>
											<de>Letzter Fehler</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['error']</value>
									</computed-column>
								</columns>
								<rows>$state['rules']</rows>
							</table>
						</tab>
						<tab id="parameters"
							icon="css:bi bi-sliders"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Parameters</en>
								<de>Parameter</de>
							</label>
							<split-panel
								orientation="horizontal"
								resizable="true"
							>
								<panes>
									<pane
										min-size="300"
										size="65"
										unit="%"
									>
										<table
											filter-bar="true"
											selection="selectedParameter"
										>
											<inputs>
												<input channel="state"/>
											</inputs>
											<columns>
												<computed-column name="rule"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="160"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Rule</en>
														<de>Regel</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['rule']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="parameter"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="140"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Parameter</en>
														<de>Parameter</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['parameter']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="type"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="100"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Type</en>
														<de>Typ</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['type']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="value"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="120"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Value</en>
														<de>Wert</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['value']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="default"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="120"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Default</en>
														<de>Vorgabe</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['default']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="overridden"
													type="tl.core:Boolean"
													width="110"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Override</en>
														<de>Überschrieben</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['overridden']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="adjustable"
													type="tl.core:Boolean"
													width="110"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Adjustable</en>
														<de>Einstellbar</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['adjustable']</value>
												</computed-column>
											</columns>
											<rows>$state['parameters']</rows>
										</table>
									</pane>
									<pane
										min-size="240"
										size="35"
										unit="%"
									>
										<panel>
											<title>
												<en>Set the parameter</en>
												<de>Parameter setzen</de>
											</title>
											<inset>
												<stack gap="default">
													<fields max-columns="1">
														<value-input
															type="tl.core:String"
															value="parameterValue"
														>
															<label>
																<en>Value (a literal: true, 21.5, 3min, 06:30)</en>
																<de>Wert (ein Literal: true, 21.5, 3min, 06:30)</de>
															</label>
														</value-input>
													</fields>
													<stack
														direction="row"
														gap="compact"
													>
														<button>
															<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																image="css:bi bi-check2"
																inputs="state, project"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Set</en>
																	<de>Setzen</de>
																</label>
																<access>
																	<operation name="Write"
																		object="$project"
																		type="ehome.project:Project"
																	/>
																</access>
																<executability>
																	<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
																</executability>
																<execute-script function="simulationSetParameter($state['project'], $selectedParameter, $parameterValue)">
																	<inputs>
																		<input channel="selectedParameter"/>
																		<input channel="parameterValue"/>
																	</inputs>
																	<with-result>
																		<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																	</with-result>
																</execute-script>
															</action>
														</button>
														<button>
															<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																image="css:bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"
																inputs="state, project"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Reset to the default</en>
																	<de>Auf die Vorgabe zurücksetzen</de>
																</label>
																<access>
																	<operation name="Write"
																		object="$project"
																		type="ehome.project:Project"
																	/>
																</access>
																<executability>
																	<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
																</executability>
																<execute-script function="simulationResetParameter($state['project'], $selectedParameter)">
																	<inputs>
																		<input channel="selectedParameter"/>
																	</inputs>
																	<with-result>
																		<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																	</with-result>
																</execute-script>
															</action>
														</button>
													</stack>
												</stack>
											</inset>
										</panel>
									</pane>
								</panes>
							</split-panel>
						</tab>
						<tab id="datapoints"
							icon="css:bi bi-list-ul"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Datapoints</en>
								<de>Datenpunkte</de>
							</label>
							<split-panel
								orientation="horizontal"
								resizable="true"
							>
								<panes>
									<pane
										min-size="300"
										size="65"
										unit="%"
									>
										<table
											filter-bar="true"
											selection="selectedDatapoint"
										>
											<inputs>
												<input channel="state"/>
											</inputs>
											<columns>
												<computed-column name="id"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="240"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Datapoint</en>
														<de>Datenpunkt</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['name']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="type"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="100"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Type</en>
														<de>Typ</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['type']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="value"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="140"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Value</en>
														<de>Wert</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['value']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="quality"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="100"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Quality</en>
														<de>Qualität</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['quality']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="updated"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="220"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Last update</en>
														<de>Letzte Änderung</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['updated']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="binding"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="220"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Binding</en>
														<de>Anbindung</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['binding']</value>
												</computed-column>
											</columns>
											<rows>$state['datapoints']</rows>
										</table>
									</pane>
									<pane
										min-size="240"
										size="35"
										unit="%"
									>
										<panel>
											<title>
												<en>Value of the datapoint</en>
												<de>Wert des Datenpunkts</de>
											</title>
											<inset>
												<stack gap="default">
													<fields max-columns="1">
														<value-input
															type="tl.core:String"
															value="datapointValue"
														>
															<label>
																<en>Value (a literal: true, 21.5, 06:30)</en>
																<de>Wert (ein Literal: true, 21.5, 06:30)</de>
															</label>
														</value-input>
													</fields>
													<stack
														direction="row"
														gap="compact"
														wrap="true"
													>
														<button>
															<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																image="css:bi bi-send"
																inputs="state, project"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Send from the installation</en>
																	<de>Aus der Installation senden</de>
																</label>
																<access>
																	<operation name="Write"
																		object="$project"
																		type="ehome.project:Project"
																	/>
																</access>
																<executability>
																	<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
																</executability>
																<execute-script function="simulationSend($state['project'], $selectedDatapoint, $datapointValue)">
																	<inputs>
																		<input channel="selectedDatapoint"/>
																		<input channel="datapointValue"/>
																	</inputs>
																	<with-result>
																		<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																	</with-result>
																</execute-script>
															</action>
														</button>
														<button>
															<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																image="css:bi bi-pencil"
																inputs="state, project"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Command</en>
																	<de>Befehlen</de>
																</label>
																<access>
																	<operation name="Write"
																		object="$project"
																		type="ehome.project:Project"
																	/>
																</access>
																<executability>
																	<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
																</executability>
																<execute-script function="simulationCommand($state['project'], $selectedDatapoint, $datapointValue)">
																	<inputs>
																		<input channel="selectedDatapoint"/>
																		<input channel="datapointValue"/>
																	</inputs>
																	<with-result>
																		<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																	</with-result>
																</execute-script>
															</action>
														</button>
													</stack>
													<text
														tone="helper"
														variant="caption"
													>
														<label>
															<en>"Send from the installation": the device whose object sends to the address of the datapoint sends the value as a group telegram, as a push button or sensor would; for a Zigbee datapoint its virtual device reports the value. "Command": the value is commanded as the UI of a controller does; a datapoint that transmits sends it to the bus or to its Zigbee device.</en>
															<de>„Aus der Installation senden“: Das Gerät, dessen Objekt an die Adresse des Datenpunkts sendet, sendet den Wert als Gruppentelegramm, wie es ein Taster oder Sensor täte; bei einem Zigbee-Datenpunkt meldet sein virtuelles Gerät den Wert. „Befehlen“: Der Wert wird befohlen, wie es die Oberfläche eines Controllers tut; ein Datenpunkt, der überträgt, sendet ihn auf den Bus oder an sein Zigbee-Gerät.</de>
														</label>
													</text>
												</stack>
											</inset>
										</panel>
									</pane>
								</panes>
							</split-panel>
						</tab>
						<tab id="zigbee"
							icon="css:bi bi-broadcast"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Zigbee devices</en>
								<de>Zigbee-Geräte</de>
							</label>
							<split-panel
								orientation="horizontal"
								resizable="true"
							>
								<panes>
									<pane
										min-size="300"
										size="65"
										unit="%"
									>
										<table
											filter-bar="true"
											selection="selectedZigbee"
										>
											<inputs>
												<input channel="state"/>
											</inputs>
											<columns>
												<computed-column name="device"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="220"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Device</en>
														<de>Gerät</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['device']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="endpoint"
													type="tl.core:Integer"
													width="90"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Endpoint</en>
														<de>Endpunkt</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['endpoint']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="function"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="140"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Function</en>
														<de>Funktion</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['function']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="id"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="240"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Datapoint</en>
														<de>Datenpunkt</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['name']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="value"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="120"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Value</en>
														<de>Wert</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['value']</value>
												</computed-column>
												<computed-column name="reported"
													type="tl.core:String"
													width="220"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Last report</en>
														<de>Letzte Meldung</de>
													</label>
													<value>$row['reported']</value>
												</computed-column>
											</columns>
											<rows>$state['zigbee']</rows>
										</table>
									</pane>
									<pane
										min-size="240"
										size="35"
										unit="%"
									>
										<panel>
											<title>
												<en>Operate the device</en>
												<de>Gerät bedienen</de>
											</title>
											<inset>
												<stack gap="default">
													<fields max-columns="1">
														<value-input
															type="tl.core:String"
															value="zigbeeValue"
														>
															<label>
																<en>Value (a literal: true, 21.5; for a button 0 off, 1 on, 2 toggle, 3 dim up, 4 dim down, 5 dim stop)</en>
																<de>Wert (ein Literal: true, 21.5; für einen Taster 0 aus, 1 ein, 2 umschalten, 3 heller, 4 dunkler, 5 Dimmen stopp)</de>
															</label>
														</value-input>
													</fields>
													<stack
														direction="row"
														gap="compact"
														wrap="true"
													>
														<button>
															<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																image="css:bi bi-broadcast"
																inputs="state, project"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Report from the device</en>
																	<de>Vom Gerät melden</de>
																</label>
																<access>
																	<operation name="Write"
																		object="$project"
																		type="ehome.project:Project"
																	/>
																</access>
																<executability>
																	<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
																</executability>
																<execute-script function="simulationSend($state['project'], $selectedZigbee, $zigbeeValue)">
																	<inputs>
																		<input channel="selectedZigbee"/>
																		<input channel="zigbeeValue"/>
																	</inputs>
																	<with-result>
																		<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																	</with-result>
																</execute-script>
															</action>
														</button>
														<button>
															<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
																image="css:bi bi-pencil"
																inputs="state, project"
															>
																<label>
																	<en>Command</en>
																	<de>Befehlen</de>
																</label>
																<access>
																	<operation name="Write"
																		object="$project"
																		type="ehome.project:Project"
																	/>
																</access>
																<executability>
																	<disabled-if expr="simulationRunVeto($state['project'], $state)"/>
																</executability>
																<execute-script function="simulationCommand($state['project'], $selectedZigbee, $zigbeeValue)">
																	<inputs>
																		<input channel="selectedZigbee"/>
																		<input channel="zigbeeValue"/>
																	</inputs>
																	<with-result>
																		<write-channel name="refresh"/>
																	</with-result>
																</execute-script>
															</action>
														</button>
													</stack>
													<text
														tone="helper"
														variant="caption"
													>
														<label>
															<en>"Report from the device": the virtual device reports the value, as the real one reports a reading or a state; for a button (Action) it is a press, and every press is an update of the datapoint, also with the value it has already. The value is refused outside the range of the function (a level 0..100 %, a battery 0..100 %, a colour temperature 16..1000000 K). "Command": the value is commanded as the UI of a controller does; a light (switch, level, colour temperature) takes it and reports it back, any other function refuses it as read-only. The timeline shows the reports, presses and commands. The devices keep their values for the next simulation of the project and report them at its start.</en>
															<de>„Vom Gerät melden“: Das virtuelle Gerät meldet den Wert, wie das echte einen Messwert oder Zustand meldet; bei einem Taster (Aktion) ist es ein Tastendruck, und jeder Druck ist eine Aktualisierung des Datenpunkts, auch mit dem Wert, den er schon hat. Ein Wert außerhalb des Bereichs der Funktion wird abgelehnt (Helligkeit 0..100 %, Batterie 0..100 %, Farbtemperatur 16..1000000 K). „Befehlen“: Der Wert wird befohlen, wie es die Oberfläche eines Controllers tut; eine Leuchte (Schalten, Helligkeit, Farbtemperatur) übernimmt ihn und meldet ihn zurück, jede andere Funktion lehnt ihn als nur lesbar ab. Die Zeitleiste zeigt die Meldungen, Tastendrücke und Befehle. Die Geräte behalten ihre Werte für die nächste Simulation des Projekts und melden sie bei deren Start.</de>
														</label>
													</text>
												</stack>
											</inset>
										</panel>
									</pane>
								</panes>
							</split-panel>
						</tab>
						<tab id="timeline"
							icon="css:bi bi-clock-history"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Timeline</en>
								<de>Zeitleiste</de>
							</label>
							<table filter-bar="true">
								<inputs>
									<input channel="state"/>
								</inputs>
								<columns>
									<computed-column name="time"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="210"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Simulated time</en>
											<de>Simulierte Zeit</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['time']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="kind"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="100"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Kind</en>
											<de>Art</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['kind']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="source"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="240"
									>
										<label>
											<en>Source</en>
											<de>Quelle</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['source']</value>
									</computed-column>
									<computed-column name="text"
										type="tl.core:String"
										width="600"
									>
										<label>
											<en>What happened</en>
											<de>Was geschah</de>
										</label>
										<value>$row['text']</value>
									</computed-column>
								</columns>
								<rows>$state['timeline']</rows>
							</table>
						</tab>
						<tab id="devices"
							icon="css:bi bi-arrow-left-right"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Device behaviour</en>
								<de>Geräteverhalten</de>
							</label>
							<split-panel
								orientation="horizontal"
								resizable="true"
							>
								<panes>
									<pane
										min-size="300"
										size="60"
										unit="%"
									>
										<panel>
											<title>
												<en>Object followers</en>
												<de>Objektfolgen</de>
											</title>
											<commands>
												<generic-command
													image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
													inputs="project"
													placement="TOOLBAR"
												>
													<label>
														<en>New object follower</en>
														<de>Neue Objektfolge</de>
													</label>
													<tooltip>
														<en>Adds a pair of objects of a device: the state object takes every value the switching object receives and sends it. Takes effect at the next start of a simulation.</en>
														<de>Legt ein Objektpaar eines Geräts an: Das Statusobjekt übernimmt jeden Wert, den das Schaltobjekt empfängt, und sendet ihn. Gilt ab dem nächsten Start einer Simulation.</de>
													</tooltip>
													<access>
														<operation name="Write"
															object="$project"
															type="ehome.project:Project"
														/>
													</access>
													<executability>
														<null-input-disabled/>
													</executability>
													<with-transaction>
														<execute-script function="{ f = new(`ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower`); $project.add(`ehome.project:Project#simulationFollowers`, $f); $f; }"/>
														<with-result>
															<write-channel name="follower"/>
														</with-result>
													</with-transaction>
												</generic-command>
												<generic-command
													image="css:bi bi-trash"
													inputs="follower"
													placement="TOOLBAR"
												>
													<label>
														<en>Delete the object follower</en>
														<de>Objektfolge löschen</de>
													</label>
													<executability>
														<null-input-disabled/>
													</executability>
													<delete-object/>
													<write-channel name="follower" clear="true"/>
												</generic-command>
											</commands>
											<stack gap="compact">
												<inset>
													<text
														tone="helper"
														variant="caption"
													>
														<label>
															<en>The program data of a device does not say what its application does between its objects. Name here which object follows which: the state object takes every value the switching object receives from the bus and sends it like its own, inverted if checked (for an object of one bit). The pairs take effect when a simulation starts.</en>
															<de>Die Programmdaten eines Geräts sagen nicht, was seine Applikation zwischen seinen Objekten tut. Hier wird festgelegt, welches Objekt welchem folgt: Das Statusobjekt übernimmt jeden Wert, den das Schaltobjekt vom Bus empfängt, und sendet ihn wie seinen eigenen, invertiert, wenn angekreuzt (für ein Objekt von einem Bit). Die Paare gelten ab dem nächsten Start einer Simulation.</de>
														</label>
													</text>
												</inset>
												<table
													observed-types="ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower"
													selection="follower"
													types="ehome.runtime:ObjectFollower"
												>
													<inputs>
														<input channel="project"/>
													</inputs>
													<columns>
														<column attribute="device"/>
														<column attribute="source"/>
														<column attribute="follower"/>
														<column attribute="inverted"/>
													</columns>
													<rows>if($project == null, [], $project.get(`ehome.project:Project#simulationFollowers`))</rows>
												</table>
											</stack>
										</panel>
									</pane>
									<pane
										min-size="240"
										size="40"
										unit="%"
									>
										<panel>
											<title>
												<en>Object follower</en>
												<de>Objektfolge</de>
											</title>
											<form
												input="follower"
												with-inset="true"
											>
												<field attribute="device"/>
												<field attribute="source">
													<input-control class="com.top_logic.layout.view.form.SelectControlProvider"
														order="as-given"
													/>
												</field>
												<field attribute="follower">
													<input-control class="com.top_logic.layout.view.form.SelectControlProvider"
														order="as-given"
													/>
												</field>
												<field attribute="inverted"/>
											</form>
										</panel>
									</pane>
								</panes>
							</split-panel>
						</tab>
					</tabs>
				</tab-bar>
			</pane>
		</panes>
	</split-panel>
</view>
